ABOUT 

Harmoney is a savings advisor web-app that helps users to take a hold on their expenditure and helps them focus on their savings depending on the goals they share

User gives details about their age, name, job, salary, other income sources, major expenses etc. and their financial goals divided into major and minor

Enter details of their goals, to be achieved in how many months, approx budget, priority , lon temr or short term etc

Give output based on the user details. 

Extra suggestions in ai chatbot. help, etc. 


-> user authentication: login, signup, securityquestions, resetpassword

->goal management: add goal, get output as savings plan through an ml model, track goal progress, goal status, editgoal, delete goal

->budget plan: after getting the budget plan through ml model, add everyday tracking of planned vs actual savings

->dashboard: goal progress and completion rate

->dreamframe : ai image generator 

->budgetbuddy: ai chatbot for financial suggestions

->email notifications: progress sent for everyday tracking and reminder emails

